Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.\NThe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am waiting for you, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am waiting for your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Far have I traveled to stand beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now in your moment of need,\NI will fight in your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to speak with\NZunisha for a moment at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can talk to the elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin predicted this years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're everything he dreamed you would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll lead this world to a new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still missing the most\Nimportant piece of this puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,After reading Father's journal, I understand\Nthat I must survive no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he tore out the most\Nimportant page before I could see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The final island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Father and Roger see there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What made them laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I struggle to understand my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father was not a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were here now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,would he still insist on opening\Nthe borders like he did before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not the wisdom to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If opening the borders puts\Nthe people of Wano in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,then I do not want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I a coward, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Charret, get inside the dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have taken our revenge, but I fear\Nthe battle for Wano is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems this island can\Ncollapse at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We had better hurry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really put your life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting roughed up, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna reel ya in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be dead, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole castle is about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hamlet, get us to the exit and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to pressure you, but lives\Nare hanging in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's ever been a time\Nto deliver, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For even ninja like you and I To be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiery battle in the third-floor\Nhallway has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Race of the Mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Gourmet of Sir\NLuffy's, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me aid you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to fight, I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest till the battle is won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you march to your own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shift. Shake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this your plan, Izo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to sacrifice\Nyourself from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would a leftover from the Whitebeard\NPirates want to help those brats?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find Nico Robin quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Ndeal with this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Imperial command\Nfrom the Five Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,From the Five Elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They said, erase Straw\NHat Luffy immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you're asking of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is fighting\Nan emperor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect me just to step into\Nthe middle of Kaido's fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer Straw Hat fights someone\Nof his caliber, the greater the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The five elders call it\Na necessary precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're worried about it,\Nthen we know the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least, we don't want\Nto find out. Understand? I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with that crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes the Straw Hats so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mathieu, thank you so much\Nfor doing such a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it from the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal, a really big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Big Mom won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you crying about, Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need Big Mom anymore\Nnow that you've got me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, Ami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can't relax just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is a bomb set to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy I hope you can wrap this up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurosaki don't worry my dear we'll get\Nout of this accursed place soon enough
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,useless ninja you're supposed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,helping me so what's the hold up huh that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,bastard didn't run away on his own did\Nhe a ninja must serve his Lord till the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,end if anyone's gonna die it should be him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wonder who caused
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that quake conjurer oh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope there's not more on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you playing music\Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize we're both\Ndead if we don't get help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you are wearing\Nthat ridiculous mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't shown me\Nyour face once have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off that mask right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Kurosaki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed yet? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackie and Trafalgar won?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we get ready, Kaido might come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hope it's Luffy\Nwho comes back for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My energy is all spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave this everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's rude to stare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a mouth, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you, mama? mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,15.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So young.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be your first\Ntime teaming up with rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you, rocks\Nis a good for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trust a word he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring it to me, mama! mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's linlin and don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have known each other\Na awfully long time, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You old hack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does that have to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a promise together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We were gonna get the one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a moment of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very emotional time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the damn room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How careless of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You got so worked up that\Nyou didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah Saki, why aren't you helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this damn rubble off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have you using your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,after all, so I stuck a sea prism\Nstone nail in you, to keep you docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We were going to escape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't love me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I never loved you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a coincidence that\Nyou like this piece so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Moon Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's beautiful, Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so good at playing. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The song's called Moon Princess\NI'm gonna try to get even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can play it at my funeral someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey momo, stop making your sister cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who made her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, the funeral thing, I'm\Nsorry, it was only a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I die and leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My father loved this song as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How peculiar that you would have\Nthe same taste as Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, every time I play it,\NI remember my father's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, even as I avenge his\Ndeath, I dare not show a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.46,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap what\Nyou guys had planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this country are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken enough from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving this fourth gear\Neverything that I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop attacking\Ntill I put an end to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what his\Nattempts are coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano doesn't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking you out!
